ing</h2>It\u2019s an ingenious use of the \u201c2.5D\u201d perspective, asking players to use 3D spatial reasoning to navigate 2D situations.<br> </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/b6ab8ab1d0355c18134d1a25056441fb.poster.avif?t=1746012393\" width=600 height=99 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/b6ab8ab1d0355c18134d1a25056441fb.webm?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steal the ground right from under your enemies! or yourself! </h2>In <strong>\u201cGeorifters\u201d</strong> you can spin walls, twist tunnels, crush critters, <strong>battle against the ground or with it!</strong> It can be your tool or a weapon you use to smash others in a series of fast paced ground busting arenas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Flip!</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/56b7861fbcb4386d72b7a488f27a7b1e.poster.avif?t=1746012393\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/56b7861fbcb4386d72b7a488f27a7b1e.webm?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/56b7861fbcb4386d72b7a488f27a7b1e.mp4?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spin!</h2></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/08e961049583f7bb73160c45466e8558.poster.avif?t=1746012393\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=