peed, battling for victory, for honor - and of course bragging rights.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/b2c76fb3f3e88317f88e2c8f10d4d004.poster.avif?t=1746012393\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/b2c76fb3f3e88317f88e2c8f10d4d004.webm?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/b2c76fb3f3e88317f88e2c8f10d4d004.mp4?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Thinker Than A Fighter? </h2></h2>No worries! Try some precision ground manipulation in co-op, against a friend, against an enemy, or a friend who is your enemy, or if you don\u2019t have any friends or enemies (good for you!) you can go lone wolf in the story mode.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/a097811a09cab99665e2e204cefe2b6e.poster.avif?t=1746012393\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/a097811a09cab99665e2e204cefe2b6e.webm?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/a097811a09cab99665e2e204cefe2b6e.mp4?t=1746012393\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bust your way through 6 fantastical worlds</h2>30+ levels, 300+ stages, each based on a unique theme. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/extras/a0a772ccd1a18ad268c657f0987097c4.poster.avif?t=1746012393\" width=6