","use_age_gate":"0"},"usk":{"rating":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"29 May, 2020"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cI was blown away by the gaming mechanics, and the vivid nature of the graphical presentation. The puzzle element is both challenging, and intriguing. Getting to grips with each different game style is tough and fun in equal measures. It works well as both a solo and Co-Op experience, and I believe has the right level of difficulty that it could be tackled as a parent and child team. Not too many games have that accolade. A game that I 100% recommend\u201d<br>8/10 \u2013 Bonus Stage<br><br>\u201cWhether you go it alone or prefer playing with friends, Georifters offers oodles of puzzle fun set in a brilliantly lively world.\u201d<br>80 \u2013 Video Chums<br><br>\u201cA fun, personality-filled puzzle-platformer that brings more to the table than you\u2019d first expect.\u201d<br>75 \u2013 GameGrin<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/ss_03da9fb9fc4e902a3b3b7cf27635bc146995c0f1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746012393","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/ss_03da9fb9fc4e902a3b3b7cf27635bc146995c0f1.600x338.jpg?t=1746012393"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/ss_690a126e2d047d8db2d7e86a44a6181a20408b96.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746012393","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/ss_690a126e2d047d8db2d7e86a44a6181a20408b96.600x338.jpg?t=1746012393"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/ss_88243ef11d958cdd7d8fdaa9a2fb5b04cdcdeb3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746012393","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1080490/ss_88243ef11d958cdd7d8fdaa9a2fb5b04cdcdeb3d.600x338.jpg?t=1746012393"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akama